    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 BUG-06: README content rendered at the same H2 level as hypergumbo's own structural sections (e.g., `## Installation` from README sits alongside `## Structure` from the tool). gemini-cli has 12 bleeding headings, alertmanager has 2. Breaks both human readability and machine parsing. Fix: demote README headings by one level when including, or scope all README content under a single `## README` H2."  # 15bb
